{"id":"lesson-src-5cd28bca07b013","moduleNumber":1093,"headword":"annual passes","title":"Annual passes","subtitle":"全年通行證、年度門票、一年期入場證——哪些說法真的接近 annual passes？","description":"全年通行證、年度門票、一年期入場證——哪些說法真的接近 annual passes？","words":[{"order":1,"word":"Yearly passes","meaning":"年度通行證；全年票","note":"和 annual passes 幾乎完全相同。Yearly 比 annual 稍口語，但核心意思都是「有效期約一年」。","example":"The zoo offers discounted yearly passes for local families.","exampleZh":"動物園為本地家庭提供折扣年度通行證。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The museum sells annual passes to frequent visitors.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"yearly passes","explanation":"幾乎完全等同 annual passes。"},{"letter":"B","text":"season tickets","explanation":"未必有效全年。"},{"letter":"C","text":"day passes","explanation":"只有效一天。"},{"letter":"D","text":"memberships","explanation":"可能包含更多福利。"},{"letter":"E","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"未表示一年期。"},{"letter":"F","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"類型不同。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Families can renew their annual passes online.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"yearly passes","explanation":"語義等同。"},{"letter":"B","text":"membership cards","explanation":"是卡片本身。"},{"letter":"C","text":"multi-entry tickets","explanation":"不一定一年。"},{"letter":"D","text":"season tickets","explanation":"有效期可能只是一季。"},{"letter":"E","text":"day passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"太廣。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Annual passes are cheaper for people who visit more than six times a year.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"yearly passes","explanation":"最直接替換。"},{"letter":"B","text":"memberships","explanation":"可能接近但範圍更廣。"},{"letter":"C","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不合入場語境。"},{"letter":"D","text":"unlimited tickets","explanation":"沒有一年期限。"},{"letter":"E","text":"season tickets","explanation":"不一定全年。"},{"letter":"F","text":"day passes","e