。","example":"Commuters can save money by purchasing annual tickets.","exampleZh":"通勤人士可以透過購買年度票節省費用。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Regular commuters often buy annual passes for the rail network.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"annual tickets","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"annual tickets","explanation":"交通語境自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"memberships","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"season tickets","explanation":"在部分交通語境可接近，但不一定精確指一年。"},{"letter":"E","text":"day tickets","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不自然。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The transport authority offers discounted annual passes.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"annual tickets","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"annual tickets","explanation":"票務語境高度接近。"},{"letter":"B","text":"annual memberships","explanation":"不一定只是交通票。"},{"letter":"C","text":"multi-entry tickets","explanation":"不一定時間制。"},{"letter":"D","text":"day passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"visitor cards","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"season tickets","explanation":"可能但時長不一定相同。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Students can purchase annual passes for unlimited bus travel.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"annual tickets","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"annual tickets","explanation":"一年期交通票。"},{"letter":"B","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不是最自然稱法。"},{"letter":"C","text":"memberships","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"day tickets","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"multi-entry tickets","explanation":"不表示全年。"}]}]},{"order":4,"word":"Yearly admission passes","meaning":"年度入場證；全年入場證","note":"和 annual admission passes 幾乎相同，只是使用 yearly。常見於博物館、動物園、主題樂園和其他景點。","example":"The aquarium sells yearly admission passes with unlimited visits.","exampleZh":"水族館出售可無限次入場的年度入場證。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The theme park's annual passes include unlimited visits.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly admission passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"yearly admission passes","explanation":"年度多次入場最精確。"},{"letter":"B","text":"season tickets","explanation":"未必全年。"},{"letter":"C","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"太廣。"},{"letter":"D","text":"day passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"memberships","explanation":"範圍可能更廣。"},{"letter":"F","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Annual passes are available at the aquarium ticket desk.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly admission passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"yearly admission passes","explanation":"水族館入場語境自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"visitor tickets","explanation":"沒有年度意味。"},{"letter":"C","text":"multi-entry tickets","explanation":"未必全年。"},{"letter":"D","text":"season passes","explanation":"可能只是一季。"},{"letter":"E","text":"memberships","explanation":"不一定等同。"},{"letter":"F","text":"day tickets","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The castle introduced annual passes for local residents.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly admission passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"yearly admission passes","explanation":"景點年度入場權。"},{"letter":"B","text":"memberships","explanation":"可能包含附加福利。"},{"letter":"C","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"太一般。"},{"letter":"D","text":"unlimited tickets","explanation":"無時間資訊。"},{"letter":"E","text":"season tickets","explanation":"不一定全年。"},{"letter":"F","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不自然。"}]}]},{"order":5,"word":"12-month passes","meaning":"十二個月通行證；一年期通行證","note":"非常接近 annual passes，但更精確地表示有效期為連續 12 個月，而不一定跟曆年對齊。","example":"The 12-month pass begins on the date of purchase.","exampleZh":"十二個月通行證由購買當日起生效。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The annual pass remains valid for twelve months from the purchase date.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"12-month pass","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"12-month pass","explanation":"明確表示連續十二個月。"},{"letter":"B","text":"annual ticket","explanation":"也接近，但沒有突出起始日。"},{"letter":"C","text":"season ticket","explanation":"可能較短。"},{"letter":"D","text":"membership card","explanation":"不同。"},{"letter":"E","text":"day pass","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"visitor pass","explanation":"太廣。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Annual passes purchased in June expire the following June.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"12-month passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"12-month passes","explanation":"購買日起 12 個月。"},{"letter":"B","text":"yearly passes","explanation":"也可，但稍不如 12-month 精確。"},{"letter":"C","text":"season tickets","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"day passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The gym offers an annual pass that starts on the day you register.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"12-month pass","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"12-month pass","explanation":"有效期計算方式最吻合。"},{"letter":"B","text":"annual admission pass","explanation":"gym 不一定以 admission 描述最自然。"},{"letter":"C","text":"season ticket","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"membership card","explanation":"卡片不等於 pass。"},{"letter":"E","text":"visitor pass","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"multi-entry ticket","explanation":"不等同。"}]}]},{"order":6,"word":"One-year passes","meaning":"一年期通行證","note":"直接、清楚地表示有效期為一年。和 annual passes 高度接近，尤其適合一般說明和票務條款。","example":"The attraction now offers one-year passes for frequent visitors.","exampleZh":"這個景點現為常客提供一年期通行證。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The attraction introduced annual passes for regular visitors.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"one-year passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"one-year passes","explanation":"直接表示一年期。"},{"letter":"B","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"沒有期限。"},{"letter":"C","text":"season tickets","explanation":"不一定一年。"},{"letter":"D","text":"memberships","explanation":"可能範圍更廣。"},{"letter":"E","text":"day passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"An annual pass costs less than twelve monthly tickets.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"one-year pass","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"one-year pass","explanation":"一年期概念直接。"},{"letter":"B","text":"season ticket","explanation":"時長不一定。"},{"letter":"C","text":"visitor pass","explanation":"太廣。"},{"letter":"D","text":"annual membership","explanation":"不是完全相同。"},{"letter":"E","text":"multi-entry ticket","explanation":"次數制。"},{"letter":"F","text":"day pass","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"They bought annual passes before the price increase.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"one-year passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"one-year passes","explanation":"高度接近。"},{"letter":"B","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"類型不同。"},{"letter":"C","text":"membership cards","explanation":"不同。"},{"letter":"D","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"不含期限。"},{"letter":"E","text":"season tickets","explanation":"可能不同。"},{"letter":"F","text":"unlimited tickets","explanation":"不含一年資訊。"}]}]},{"order":7,"word":"Annual admission passes","meaning":"年度入場證；全年入場通行證","note":"和 annual passes 幾乎完全相同，但加入 admission，明確指出用途是進入某個場所。","example":"Annual admission passes include unlimited entry during normal opening hours.","exampleZh":"年度入場證包括在正常開放時間內無限次入場。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The museum's annual passes allow unlimited entry during opening hours.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"annual admission passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"annual admission passes","explanation":"明確是入場用途。"},{"letter":"B","text":"annual tickets","explanation":"也可，但 admission pass 更清楚。"},{"letter":"C","text":"memberships","explanation":"可能有額外福利。"},{"letter":"D","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"缺乏年度意味。"},{"letter":"E","text":"day passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Local residents receive a discount on annual passes to the gardens.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"annual admission passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"annual admission passes","explanation":"景點入場語境。"},{"letter":"B","text":"season tickets","explanation":"不一定全年。"},{"letter":"C","text":"multi-entry tickets","explanation":"不一定一年。"},{"letter":"D","text":"membership cards","explanation":"不等同。"},{"letter":"E","text":"day tickets","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"visitor cards","explanation":"太廣。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Annual passes can be scanned at any entrance gate.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"annual admission passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"annual admission passes","explanation":"entrance gate 明確提示入場用途。"},{"letter":"B","text":"annual memberships","explanation":"不一定以 pass 形式掃描。"},{"letter":"C","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"day passes","explanation":"時限錯誤。"},{"letter":"E","text":"season tickets","explanation":"期限不一定相同。"},{"letter":"F","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"未表示年度。"}]}]},{"order":8,"word":"Yearly access passes","meaning":"年度使用通行證；全年存取證","note":"表示一年內持續獲得某場地、設施或服務的進入／使用權。比 admission pass 稍廣，可包括設施使用。","example":"The sports centre offers yearly access passes for regular users.","exampleZh":"體育中心為經常使用設施的人提供年度通行證。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The sports centre offers annual passes for people who use the facilities regularly.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly access passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"yearly access passes","explanation":"強調全年設施使用權。"},{"letter":"B","text":"memberships","explanation":"可能接近但可包括更多福利。"},{"letter":"C","text":"season tickets","explanation":"不一定全年。"},{"letter":"D","text":"visitor passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"E","text":"day passes","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"F","text":"subscriptions","explanation":"不自然。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"Annual passes provide unlimited access to the climbing centre.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"yearly access passes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"y